#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD0089 expect=skipped domain=TE
#note "NEITHER column is declared, so the All leg is unmet and the parent skips - unchanged in verdict from the Any gate, but the state is no longer silent: the dataset sister PMDA-SD9729 (Sensitivity Dataset) reports the absent pair once. The old DIRECTION-PIN reasoning written for the Any leg is retired with the wave E Any -> All rewrite; the direction is now pinned by the four-state set (parent + two R-5.25 siblings + sister), whose scenarios each name the member owning the neighbouring state. The 0-row companion: the All leg is decided from the DECLARED columns above any row handling, so the verdict does not depend on there being rows to project from."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TE label="Trial Elements"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col ETCD    type=Char label="Element Code"
col ELEMENT type=Char label="Description of Element"
col TESTRL  type=Char label="Rule for Start of Element"
---
